# UI component triple rule

When you CREATE or EDIT any file in `src/components/ui/`:
1. Update the sibling `*.stories.tsx` (every variant/state, Light/Dark, LTR/RTL).
2. Update the sibling `*.test.tsx` (render + variant + axe, `pnpm test` green).
3. Use only `cn()` + CVA + semantic vars (`bg-primary`, never brand hex); React 19 ref-as-prop.
Reject the change in review if any sibling is missing.
